# Ant-Man, Colony Commander: "Whenever you put a +1/+1 counter on a creature, create a 1/1 green Insect creature token. This ability
# triggers only once each turn." On turn 3 Bot1's first Go Nuts! on Ant-Man makes one Insect (Ant-Man 3/3); the second the same turn
